(5684097, 827258, 32011, '<td valign="top">Ah... Melbourne''s shot tower.  Have been wanting to shoehorn this into a DPC challenge for ages, and you''ve managed to get a beautiful photo which isn''t even close to being a shoe horn... fits the challenge perfectly.  Well done.  Composition is perfect, and the colours are great.  I particularly love the hint of the building on the outside in the bottom right of the image.  Marvelous.</td>', 'Ah... Melbourne''s shot tower.  Have been wanting to shoehorn this into a DPC challenge for ages, and you''ve managed to get a beautiful photo which isn''t even close to being a shoe horn... fits the challenge perfectly.  Well done.  Composition is perfect, and the colours are great.  I particularly love the hint of the building on the outside in the bottom right of the image.  Marvelous.', '2009-10-12 02:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
