(5684309, 826958, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and quite lovely.  I like the dischord of the slight slants.</td>', 'Simple and quite lovely.  I like the dischord of the slight slants.', '2009-10-12 09:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684311, 826679, 30982, '<td valign="top">Best of the "windshield" window shots, mostly because you went wide but also because you added the "wow" factor with the zoomie light bits.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Best of the "windshield" window shots, mostly because you went wide but also because you added the "wow" factor with the zoomie light bits.  Cool shot.', '2009-10-12 09:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684312, 827254, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  A nice glimpse.  Nice handling of the light and the differing color tones it has, and I like your viewpoint to include the young man working in the back.</td>', 'Wonderful!  A nice glimpse.  Nice handling of the light and the differing color tones it has, and I like your viewpoint to include the young man working in the back.', '2009-10-12 09:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684313, 827026, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quiet and mysterious.  Could be sad, could be unsettling, depending on your viewpoint.  Light is handled beautifully.</td>', 'Quiet and mysterious.  Could be sad, could be unsettling, depending on your viewpoint.  Light is handled beautifully.', '2009-10-12 09:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684314, 827228, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fun!!  And wonderful use of vibrant color.</td>', 'Fun!!  And wonderful use of vibrant color.', '2009-10-12 09:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684315, 826619, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great catch, of the environment (the half glass with the dot dots is awesome) and of the light, with the way it reflects back, picks up bits of the outside to blend with the inside.)  And you have a young James Dean contemplating life.  Very well seen.</td>', 'Great catch, of the environment (the half glass with the dot dots is awesome) and of the light, with the way it reflects back, picks up bits of the outside to blend with the inside.)  And you have a young James Dean contemplating life.  Very well seen.', '2009-10-12 09:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684316, 826982, 30982, '<td valign="top">Just read a book by that title.  Great use of reflections, to create a bit of a world inside a world.  Neat color bits going on as well.</td>', 'Just read a book by that title.  Great use of reflections, to create a bit of a world inside a world.  Neat color bits going on as well.', '2009-10-12 09:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684321, 827218, 30982, '<td valign="top">But but... that''s an armadillo!  And I think I see zippers and a windshield wiper.  The zipper would indicate a jeep, but I can''t quite reconcile the windshield wiper against the vent and the view, which makes this all the more interesting and perplexing.  AND the armadillo appears to be investigating snow.  Very engaging shot.</td>', 'But but... that''s an armadillo!  And I think I see zippers and a windshield wiper.  The zipper would indicate a jeep, but I can''t quite reconcile the windshield wiper against the vent and the view, which makes this all the more interesting and perplexing.  AND the armadillo appears to be investigating snow.  Very engaging shot.', '2009-10-12 09:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684322, 827145, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is one of Jeb''s views of the world.  Nice view!</td>', 'I''m guessing this is one of Jeb''s views of the world.  Nice view!', '2009-10-12 09:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684323, 827046, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hell of an afternoon visitor!  Great catch and amazing clarity through the glass.</td>', 'Hell of an afternoon visitor!  Great catch and amazing clarity through the glass.', '2009-10-12 09:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684325, 827146, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture in picture kinda thing!  Very well seen and captured.</td>', 'Excellent picture in picture kinda thing!  Very well seen and captured.', '2009-10-12 09:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684326, 827027, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bold bright and delightful!  Love the clarity and "cleanness" or crispness of this.  Fun shot, particularly the light thingies in the foreground.  Great find for this challenge.</td>', 'Bold bright and delightful!  Love the clarity and "cleanness" or crispness of this.  Fun shot, particularly the light thingies in the foreground.  Great find for this challenge.', '2009-10-12 09:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
