(5684665, 827258, 96881, '<td valign="top">Ahhh.  Makes me think of home........A shame that you didn''t have blue sky to really show up against the Melbourne Central Cone........The Shot Tower in from the side helps lead the eyes into the great Geometric shapes that the cone produces.......Really like the border that you have on this as well....Adds to the geometric effect of the whole image.........</td>', 'Ahhh.  Makes me think of home........A shame that you didn''t have blue sky to really show up against the Melbourne Central Cone........The Shot Tower in from the side helps lead the eyes into the great Geometric shapes that the cone produces.......Really like the border that you have on this as well....Adds to the geometric effect of the whole image.........', '2009-10-12 16:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
