(5685204, 827286, 50695, '<td valign="top">Stories within stories, within movies, within Hitchcock within a French New Wave. They say a movie is a dream. This photo is a dream. It cried out to me. It told me that this cold, empty site had no outerwear for it. I am not without compassion. And so, I tear my shirt into ribbons and give you the blue one.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Stories within stories, within movies, within Hitchcock within a French New Wave. They say a movie is a dream. This photo is a dream. It cried out to me. It told me that this cold, empty site had no outerwear for it. I am not without compassion. And so, I tear my shirt into ribbons and give you the blue one. ', '2009-10-13 00:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685206, 826958, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ll be in your dream if you''ll be in mine, Bob Dylan said that. I''m already in your dream and I''ve been overexposed. I said that. But you pictured it.<br/> <br/>This photo is a perfection of not-meaning, negative capability as a bridal veil. I give it my Posthumous Red Ribbon for the wedding night.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I''ll be in your dream if you''ll be in mine, Bob Dylan said that. I''m already in your dream and I''ve been overexposed. I said that. But you pictured it. This photo is a perfection of not-meaning, negative capability as a bridal veil. I give it my Posthumous Red Ribbon for the wedding night. ', '2009-10-13 00:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685208, 827021, 50695, '<td valign="top">Such a perfect edge between seeing and not-seeing should be rewarded. I''m giving you my own personal yellow ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Such a perfect edge between seeing and not-seeing should be rewarded. I''m giving you my own personal yellow ribbon. ', '2009-10-13 00:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
