(5685340, 827254, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure! would have liked to see a tighter crop</td>', 'Nice exposure! would have liked to see a tighter crop', '2009-10-13 08:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685341, 827041, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  would have liked to see it from a more leveled point of view, rather than looking up (causing the top of the window to tilt in)... I know this can be tricky though... try to find a ladder  =)</td>', 'Nice shot!  would have liked to see it from a more leveled point of view, rather than looking up (causing the top of the window to tilt in)... I know this can be tricky though... try to find a ladder  =)', '2009-10-13 08:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685343, 827217, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice find, but with many of the other shots, you have cropped off part of teh window, it would have been nicer to see teh while window view</td>', 'Nice find, but with many of the other shots, you have cropped off part of teh window, it would have been nicer to see teh while window view', '2009-10-13 08:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685345, 827017, 96614, '<td valign="top">your processing is really well done!  but that tree kinda gets in the way... it looks like you were riding an escelator up... next time, go reight to the top floor, go the the middle of the floor and look up to get a centered composition, it might help with that tree, still great work!</td>', 'your processing is really well done!  but that tree kinda gets in the way... it looks like you were riding an escelator up... next time, go reight to the top floor, go the the middle of the floor and look up to get a centered composition, it might help with that tree, still great work!', '2009-10-13 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685346, 826994, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice framing!</td>', 'Nice framing!', '2009-10-13 08:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685350, 826398, 96614, '<td valign="top">Your editing is AMAZING!!!.... part of me wantes to complain about that edge on the bottom left... BUT that ledge helps your shot fit the challenge... and, well it''s clearly shot through a window...  please post some editing steps  =)  <br/> <br/>(8)</td>', 'Your editing is AMAZING!!!.... part of me wantes to complain about that edge on the bottom left... BUT that ledge helps your shot fit the challenge... and, well it''s clearly shot through a window...  please post some editing steps  =)   (8)', '2009-10-13 08:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685352, 827143, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice framing!  you should have moved the lamp a tad to the left a tad and cropped a tad more off the right to get an image exactly symmetrical about teh center.... sorry to be so picky... but it would really help your score  =)</td>', 'Nice framing!  you should have moved the lamp a tad to the left a tad and cropped a tad more off the right to get an image exactly symmetrical about teh center.... sorry to be so picky... but it would really help your score  =)', '2009-10-13 08:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685353, 827145, 96614, '<td valign="top">This looks awesome!  I hate to, but I have to say that I feel a bit cramped at the top of the frame... I would like to see more window in the top...(above the opening) it''s still awesome!</td>', 'This looks awesome!  I hate to, but I have to say that I feel a bit cramped at the top of the frame... I would like to see more window in the top...(above the opening) it''s still awesome!', '2009-10-13 08:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685354, 827220, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  i think it would have looked better if you were able to get the whole word "Design" in the frame though</td>', 'Nice find!  i think it would have looked better if you were able to get the whole word "Design" in the frame though', '2009-10-13 08:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685356, 827018, 96614, '<td valign="top">NICE!!! i''ve never been able to get a good shot out a plane window =)  I would like to see this on the front page  =)    Hopefully a 9 will help  =)</td>', 'NICE!!! i''ve never been able to get a good shot out a plane window =)  I would like to see this on the front page  =)    Hopefully a 9 will help  =)', '2009-10-13 08:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685428, 827145, 109389, '<td valign="top">I love this. Reminds me of an old-timey movie like Little Shop of Horrors or something.</td>', 'I love this. Reminds me of an old-timey movie like Little Shop of Horrors or something.', '2009-10-13 11:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685500, 827177, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not doing a whole lot for me, is this: mainly because the desaturation seems wholly arbitrary. Looks like a cool greenhouse though, so to speak.</td>', 'Not doing a whole lot for me, is this: mainly because the desaturation seems wholly arbitrary. Looks like a cool greenhouse though, so to speak.', '2009-10-13 13:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685503, 827139, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst the technical stuff is all spot on - faultless, one might almost say - the subject, the fact that I''m thinking ''why show this to me?'' and not finding an answer that makes me want to look longer, is the down-side. That, and the tilt that I''m struggling with comspositionally.</td>', 'Whilst the technical stuff is all spot on - faultless, one might almost say - the subject, the fact that I''m thinking ''why show this to me?'' and not finding an answer that makes me want to look longer, is the down-side. That, and the tilt that I''m struggling with comspositionally.', '2009-10-13 13:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685507, 827290, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think your framing  is squeezing your subject here - to the extent that I thought I''d scrolled down too far and cut off the top of the image. Quite well executed as a shot, but lacks real punch - as a window display it''s quite cluttered, and your photo hasn''t really done anything to reduce that, or to add any dynamic.</td>', 'I think your framing  is squeezing your subject here - to the extent that I thought I''d scrolled down too far and cut off the top of the image. Quite well executed as a shot, but lacks real punch - as a window display it''s quite cluttered, and your photo hasn''t really done anything to reduce that, or to add any dynamic.', '2009-10-13 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685509, 827251, 6999, '<td valign="top">I quite like the threat level, although the slightly noir cliché aspect of it is undermining things. The wacky low level tonality is pretty cool though.</td>', 'I quite like the threat level, although the slightly noir cliché aspect of it is undermining things. The wacky low level tonality is pretty cool though.', '2009-10-13 13:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685510, 827027, 6999, '<td valign="top">Looks completely fake, which may be a testament to your power over the processing controls - but which isn''t, from me, a compliment, I''m afraid. Pretty colours mind, but I haven''t had much interest in the ''pretty'' for some years now ...</td>', 'Looks completely fake, which may be a testament to your power over the processing controls - but which isn''t, from me, a compliment, I''m afraid. Pretty colours mind, but I haven''t had much interest in the ''pretty'' for some years now ...', '2009-10-13 13:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685512, 826679, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ugh, personally. What''s wrong, exactly, with a photograph feeling like a photograph? This feels like some clever dynamic range manipulation and over-smooth rendering of a complex model. I''m sure its all very clever and technical and all, but really ... and the apparent loss of scale is hilarious. Oooh! Look! He''s a got a really small hand! So I don''t like it.</td>', 'Ugh, personally. What''s wrong, exactly, with a photograph feeling like a photograph? This feels like some clever dynamic range manipulation and over-smooth rendering of a complex model. I''m sure its all very clever and technical and all, but really ... and the apparent loss of scale is hilarious. Oooh! Look! He''s a got a really small hand! So I don''t like it.', '2009-10-13 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685514, 826932, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now this intrigues - has a sense of hyper-realist painting, more so because of the great point of view. I really like the geometric structure of that frame , almost like a square spiral. Neatly done.</td>', 'Now this intrigues - has a sense of hyper-realist painting, more so because of the great point of view. I really like the geometric structure of that frame , almost like a square spiral. Neatly done.', '2009-10-13 13:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685516, 826964, 6999, '<td valign="top">I know why the caged child sucks its fingers?</td>', 'I know why the caged child sucks its fingers?', '2009-10-13 13:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685520, 827236, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing sense of the graphic; not sure if it''s to my taste, but made me think at least. The high contrast vibe is certainly up my street, but there''s a sense that, in such a regimented and basically rectilinear composition, the distortion of a slightly obtuse angle of shot is undermining your intent. Maybe that was a sense of conflict you were after, but maybe also it isn''t carried out well enough to have proper impact.</td>', 'Intriguing sense of the graphic; not sure if it''s to my taste, but made me think at least. The high contrast vibe is certainly up my street, but there''s a sense that, in such a regimented and basically rectilinear composition, the distortion of a slightly obtuse angle of shot is undermining your intent. Maybe that was a sense of conflict you were after, but maybe also it isn''t carried out well enough to have proper impact.', '2009-10-13 13:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685522, 827017, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite small, and so has, along with the pictorial sheen you''ve given it, a sense of the vignette. Might use more ''ping'' perhaps, but is evidently competent photography - although less so on the re-sizing.</td>', 'Quite small, and so has, along with the pictorial sheen you''ve given it, a sense of the vignette. Might use more ''ping'' perhaps, but is evidently competent photography - although less so on the re-sizing.', '2009-10-13 13:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685528, 827292, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like your sense of composition, and the concealment of those little secret moments works well; I wonder if, for such a complex and fractured image (in a good way), a little reduction of the overall dynamic range might not make it more accessible? Allow a little stronger a sense of reality, and the chaos of the funky reflections and so on will still prevail?</td>', 'Like your sense of composition, and the concealment of those little secret moments works well; I wonder if, for such a complex and fractured image (in a good way), a little reduction of the overall dynamic range might not make it more accessible? Allow a little stronger a sense of reality, and the chaos of the funky reflections and so on will still prevail?', '2009-10-13 13:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685537, 826733, 15711, '<td valign="top">Holy @%&amp;(!!!!</td>', 'Holy @%&(!!!!', '2009-10-13 14:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
