(5687184, 827251, 96881, '<td valign="top">Perfect for this challenge.  A really good image where the window makes the photograph, rather than being a distraction.  The pporcessing for this is spot on, the overall dark feel perfect.  Really like the crop as well.  The light from the top right of the window is really good, adding to the effect as well and the overall lighting.......Nothing to suggest cause I think you got this pretty much spot on..........well done</td>', 'Perfect for this challenge.  A really good image where the window makes the photograph, rather than being a distraction.  The pporcessing for this is spot on, the overall dark feel perfect.  Really like the crop as well.  The light from the top right of the window is really good, adding to the effect as well and the overall lighting.......Nothing to suggest cause I think you got this pretty much spot on..........well done', '2009-10-14 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687189, 827228, 96881, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but the overll effect does not work in the end.  I just find the effect that the entire image is out of focus distracting............Maybe if the depth of field was a little greater, so that she was not as far out of focus, it may have worked a bit better.....</td>', 'A good idea, but the overll effect does not work in the end.  I just find the effect that the entire image is out of focus distracting............Maybe if the depth of field was a little greater, so that she was not as far out of focus, it may have worked a bit better.....', '2009-10-14 14:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687195, 827178, 96881, '<td valign="top">I do note that there actually isn''t a window in the frame, but the intent is there so no issues with me.  However I do find the overall crop and view to be a little incomplete.  The steering wheel is just cut off, the orange mess is in the focus point, there just isn''t something to grab the attention.  Maybe a different angle on this could have really made it work.</td>', 'I do note that there actually isn''t a window in the frame, but the intent is there so no issues with me.  However I do find the overall crop and view to be a little incomplete.  The steering wheel is just cut off, the orange mess is in the focus point, there just isn''t something to grab the attention.  Maybe a different angle on this could have really made it work.', '2009-10-14 14:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687198, 826835, 96881, '<td valign="top">It might be clear ahead, but I can''t see that.  All I can see is a blocked road by the car ahead.  The kid doesn''t really add to the image though, the cropped cars on both sides also don''t help, and by the different angles, it feels like I am on a lean too.......</td>', 'It might be clear ahead, but I can''t see that.  All I can see is a blocked road by the car ahead.  The kid doesn''t really add to the image though, the cropped cars on both sides also don''t help, and by the different angles, it feels like I am on a lean too.......', '2009-10-14 15:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5687205, 827161, 96881, '<td valign="top">The window in this image is a negative, and not a positive.  The refelcting lines across the image are just a massive distraction, and interupts the entire flow of the image here.  Even the crop is a little tight on the right hand side of the image.........</td>', 'The window in this image is a negative, and not a positive.  The refelcting lines across the image are just a massive distraction, and interupts the entire flow of the image here.  Even the crop is a little tight on the right hand side of the image.........', '2009-10-14 15:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
