(5692970, 827192, 103142, '<td valign="top">I thought this shot was wonderfully done and very intriguing!<br/> <br/>You''ve been awarded the bluebird award!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=935058" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous ribbons thread</a> <br/></td>', 'I thought this shot was wonderfully done and very intriguing! You''ve been awarded the bluebird award!  Posthumous ribbons thread ', '2009-10-19 22:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5692973, 827112, 103142, '<td valign="top">As I said before, this was one of my top three favorite shots. There was so much to explore. I loved that the reflection was so clear, and yet you could still see the city. I love the looks on the people''s faces. The more you look at it, the more you see. It''s not a pretty landscape, there''s just so much more story here.<br/> <br/>You''ve been awarded the bluebird award!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=935058" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous ribbons thread</a> <br/></td>', 'As I said before, this was one of my top three favorite shots. There was so much to explore. I loved that the reflection was so clear, and yet you could still see the city. I love the looks on the people''s faces. The more you look at it, the more you see. It''s not a pretty landscape, there''s just so much more story here. You''ve been awarded the bluebird award!  Posthumous ribbons thread ', '2009-10-19 22:27:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5692976, 826958, 103142, '<td valign="top">I loved this one. I love the angles and the shapes. It''s extremely interesting. I''m so glad you entered it!<br/> <br/>You''ve been awarded the bluebird award!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=935058" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous ribbons thread</a> <br/></td>', 'I loved this one. I love the angles and the shapes. It''s extremely interesting. I''m so glad you entered it! You''ve been awarded the bluebird award!  Posthumous ribbons thread ', '2009-10-19 22:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
